	(text_box "Normal behavior has the relay be open.\nIf power is present, it will be closed and the system will be supplied.\nOnce any OV/UV/OC event is received from one of the cells, the\nrelay will latch open and will be in this state until a manual clear is\nissued either with SW1 or a power reset."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 213.36 85.725 0)
		(size 50.8 17.145)
